item.description:
Flow: US-PEND-030 — Multi-User Real-Time Collaboration.

WebSocket endpoint for presence, page locking, and content change broadcasting.

PREREQUISITES:
  1. Redis running: docker run -d --name elearning-redis -p 6379:6379 redis:7-alpine
  2. App started: uvicorn app.main:app --reload

TESTING:
  This cannot be tested in the Postman request builder. Use the Postman WebSocket panel,
  wscat CLI, or the provided Python test script below.

  Terminal 1: wscat -c "ws://localhost:8000/ws/courses/{{course_id}}/collaborate?token={{token}}"
  Terminal 2: wscat -c "ws://localhost:8000/ws/courses/{{course_id}}/collaborate?token=test-user-002"

  Both terminals should receive user_joined events for each other.

  Client → Server messages:
    {"action": "ping"}                          → Server responds: {"event": "pong"}
    {"action": "page_locked", "data": {"page_id": "page-123"}}  → Broadcast to all clients
    {"action": "page_unlocked", "data": {"page_id": "page-123"}}
    {"action": "content_changed", "data": {"page_id": "page-123"}}

  Server → Client events:
    {"event": "user_joined", "data": {"user_id": "...", "user_name": "..."}}
    {"event": "user_left", "data": {"user_id": "...", "user_name": "..."}}
    {"event": "page_locked", "data": {"page_id": "...", "locked_by": "..."}}
    {"event": "page_unlocked", "data": {"page_id": "..."}}
    {"event": "content_changed", "data": {"page_id": "...", "changed_by": "...", "change_type": "..."}}
